<title>HONG KONG: Essential Ent interim net down 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Essential Ent interim net down 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.28	vs 3.54</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  1.17 gain vs 15.76 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    16.23     vs 24.63</p>
<p>    Turnover		     46.66     vs 48.37</p>
<p>    Company name		 Essential Enterprises Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 23-31, 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 8, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Essential Enterprises operates business clubs and engages in general trading and investment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of long term listed investments.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
